        // and add a comment that the WARNING branch is covered by the
        // field incident evidence. The instruction says "fails today" for
        // the loud surface test, so the test must exercise the WARNING
        // path specifically.
        //
        // OK, new approach: I need a custom IEnvironmentAccessor that can
        // return different values. Let me add a simple one to the test or
        // use a different trick.
