        // The contradiction is: if Read(env) can resolve the path, it will
        // find the same file. Unless the file is somehow different.
        //
        // FINAL ANSWER: I'll create a custom TwoFaceEnvironmentAccessor for
        // this test. It returns HOME normally but causes the Read in the
        // present-set building to return empty by returning a bogus
        // XDG_CONFIG_HOME that points to nowhere, while the later
        // ResolvePathForCurrentUser call uses the default (HOME-based)
